<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Dutch Top Five index.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Dutch Top Five index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued two million European-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Dutch Top Five index, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one top five index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    CALL 850 DFL     PUT   850 DFL</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     CALL 56.75 DFL   PUT   64.35 DFL</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.AUG.97		 PAYDATE	19.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX (APPLIED)	   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  847.31 DFL  NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  BZET</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
